# Analysis baseline: track the data files sourcevision reads back plus the
# AI-facing outputs, so teammates and CI skip a re-analysis pass. Everything
# else (callgraph.json ~60MB, history/, .cache/, exports) is regenerated by
# `ndx analyze` and stays local.
*
!.gitignore
!hints.md
!manifest.json
!project-profile.json
!inventory.json
!imports.json
!classifications.json
!zones.json
!components.json
!CONTEXT.md
!llms.txt
!zones/
!zones/**
